{"id":"5db20853-a6a5-4f0b-bade-c8d360f811d9","createdAt":"2026-10-27T05:11:53.972Z","batchId":"onboarding_qwen3-8-flash-gateway_low","approach":"html","modelId":"qwen3.8-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"onboarding","prompt":"A three-step onboarding wizard: account, preferences, done. Show the current step and next/back buttons.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n\n  <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <h1>Set up your workspace</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead muted\">Complete these three steps to get your account ready. It takes about two minutes.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Step Indicator -->\n  <div class=\"row gap-lg center\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\" style=\"flex:1; text-align:center\">\n      <div class=\"stat-value\" style=\"font-size:1.2rem; color:var(--accent, #3b82f6)\">1</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-label\" style=\"font-weight:600; color:var(--accent, #3b82f6)\">Account</div>\n      <div class=\"progress\"><div style=\"width:100%\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\" style=\"flex:1; text-align:center\">\n      <div class=\"stat-value\" style=\"font-size:1.2rem; opacity:0.4\">2</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-label\" style=\"opacity:0.4\">Preferences</div>\n      <div class=\"progress\"><div style=\"width:0%\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\" style=\"flex:1; text-align:center\">\n      <div class=\"stat-value\" style=\"font-size:1.2rem; opacity:0.4\">3</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-label\" style=\"opacity:0.4\">Done</div>\n      <div class=\"progress\"><div style=\"width:0%\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Step 1: Account -->\n  <div id=\"step-1\" class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n    <div>\n      <h2>Account details</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Tell us who you are so we can personalise your experience.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\">\n      <div>\n        <label>\n          First name\n          <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Jordan\" value=\"Jordan\">\n        </label>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <label>\n          Last name\n          <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Ellis\" value=\"Ellis\">\n        </label>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <label>\n        Work email\n        <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"jordan@company.com\" value=\"jordan@company.com\">\n      </label>\n      <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin-top:4px\">We'll send a confirmation link to verify this address.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <label>\n        Password\n        <input type=\"password\" placeholder=\"Minimum 8 characters\" value=\"securepass123\">\n      </label>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">\n        <span class=\"small\" style=\"color:var(--success, #10b981)\">✓ 12 characters</span>\n        <span class=\"small\" style=\"color:var(--success, #10b981)\">✓ Upper &amp; lower</span>\n        <span class=\"small\" style=\"color:var(--success, #10b981)\">✓ Number included</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <label>\n        Your role\n        <select>\n          <option>Product Manager</option>\n          <option>Engineer</option>\n          <option>Designer</option>\n          <option selected>Marketing Lead</option>\n          <option>Founder / CEO</option>\n          <option>Other</option>\n        </select>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row between\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" disabled>Back</button>\n      <button class=\"btn\" onclick=\"goToStep(2)\">Continue →</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Step 2: Preferences -->\n  <div id=\"step-2\" class=\"card stack gap-lg\" style=\"display:none\">\n    <div>\n      <h2>Your preferences</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Customise how the app looks and how we communicate with you.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <h3>Appearance</h3>\n      <div class=\"row gap-lg\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">\n        <label class=\"check\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"theme\" checked> Light mode\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"check\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"theme\"> Dark mode\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"check\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"theme\"> System default\n        </label>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr class=\"hr\">\n\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h3>Notifications</h3>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Choose how often you'd like to hear from us.</p>\n      <div class=\"row gap-lg\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">\n        <label class=\"check\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Product updates &amp; tips\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"check\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Mentions &amp; replies\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"check\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\"> Weekly digest email\n        </label>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr class=\"hr\">\n\n    <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\">\n      <div>\n        <label>\n          Language\n          <select>\n            <option selected>English (US)</option>\n            <option>English (UK)</option>\n            <option>Deutsch</option>\n            <option>Français</option>\n            <option>Español</option>\n            <option>日本語</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <label>\n          Timezone\n          <select>\n            <option>UTC−08:00 Pacific Time</option>\n            <option>UTC−05:00 Eastern Time</option>\n            <option selected>UTC+00:00 London</option>\n            <option>UTC+01:00 Central European</option>\n            <option>UTC+09:00 Japan</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr class=\"hr\">\n\n    <div>\n      <label>Default dashboard view</label>\n      <div class=\"row gap-lg\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"dash\" checked> Overview</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"dash\"> Analytics</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"dash\"> Tasks</label>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row between\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"goToStep(1)\">← Back</button>\n      <button class=\"btn\" onclick=\"goToStep(3)\">Continue →</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Step 3: Done -->\n  <div id=\"step-3\" class=\"card stack gap-lg\" style=\"display:none\">\n    <div class=\"center stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"stat-value\" style=\"font-size:2.4rem; color:var(--success, #10b981)\">✓</div>\n      <h2>You're all set, Jordan!</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead muted\">Your workspace is ready. Here's a summary of your setup:</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\">\n      <div class=\"card\" style=\"background:var(--surface-2, #f8fafc)\">\n        <div class=\"stat-label\">Account</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-value\" style=\"font-size:1rem; margin-top:4px\">Jordan Ellis</div>\n        <div class=\"small muted\">jordan@company.com</div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><span class=\"badge\">Marketing Lead</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\" style=\"background:var(--surface-2, #f8fafc)\">\n        <div class=\"stat-label\">Preferences</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-value\" style=\"font-size:1rem; margin-top:4px\">Light · English (US)</div>\n        <div class=\"small muted\">UTC+00:00 London</div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">2 notifications on</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"alert\" style=\"margin-top:0\">\n      <strong>Next step:</strong> Invite your team members to collaborate from the workspace settings.\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row between\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"goToStep(2)\">← Back</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-lg\">Go to dashboard →</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<script>\nfunction goToStep(n) {\n  document.getElementById('step-1').style.display = n === 1 ? 'block' : 'none';\n  document.getElementById('step-2').style.display = n === 2 ? 'block' : 'none';\n  document.getElementById('step-3').style.display = n === 3 ? 'block' : 'none';\n  const indicators = document.querySelectorAll('.progress > div');\n  indicators[0].style.width = n >= 1 ? '100%' : '0%';\n  indicators[1].style.width = n >= 2 ? '100%' : '0%';\n  indicators[2].style.width = n >= 3 ? '100%' : '0%';\n  const vals = document.querySelectorAll('.stat-value');\n  vals[0].style.color = n >= 1 ? 'var(--accent, #3b82f6)' : '';\n  vals[0].style.opacity = '1';\n  vals[1].style.opacity = n >= 2 ? '1' : '0.4';\n  vals[1].style.color = n >= 2 ? 'var(--accent, #3b82f6)' : '';\n  vals[2].style.opacity = n >= 3 ? '1' : '0.4';\n  vals[2].style.color = n >= 3 ? 'var(--accent, #3b82f6)' : '';\n}\n</script>","deltas":[[5303,"<div"],[5418," class=\"page stack"],[5418," gap-lg\">\n\n"],[5484,"  <div class"],[5488,"=\"stack gap-sm"],[5591,"\">\n    <"],[5592,"h1>Set"],[5623," up your workspace"],[5624,"</h1>"],[5692,"\n    <p"],[5772," class=\"lead muted"],[5835,"\">Complete these three"],[5843," steps to get"],[5898," your account ready."],[5931," It takes about two"],[5965," minutes.</p>"],[5968,"\n  </div"],[6071,">\n\n  <!--"],[6101," Step Indicator -->\n"],[6102,"  <"],[6172,"div class=\"row"],[6173," gap-lg center\">"],[6280,"\n    <div"],[6397," class=\"stack gap"],[6398,"-sm\" style"],[6414,"=\"flex:1"],[6415,"; text"